+// EXPERIMENTAL, 2026-08-26. Same conv as conv2d_int8_evt_o_hat plus MoDiff's a_hat update,
+// CTA-partitioned inside the conv kernel instead of paid in the bandwidth-bound GN kernel.
+// A measurement instrument: it prices what the conv charges to absorb that traffic. `a_hat` and
+// `code` are the SAME tensors the GN kernel would have written / did write.
